{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>WARNING: This game contains many scenes with flashing lights and may not be suitable for players with light sensitivity.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>Obfuscation</strong></i> is a first person\u00a0psychological horror game. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Story Background</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Waking up in an unfamiliar house, you don't seem to know or remember anything. Explore the house to discover the truth that someone or something is trying to keep in the dark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119050/extras/gif1.gif?t=1747063551\" /> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <i>Obfuscation</i>, the boundary of reality melts away as the paranormal seeps in. Unexplained occurrences, eerie phenomena, and ghostly encounters distort your perception, leaving you questioning what is real and what lurks just beyond sight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119050/extras/gif2.gif?t=1747063551\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119050/extras/gif3New.gif?t=1747063551\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119050/extras/gif3.gif?t=1747063551\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3119050?t=1747063551","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119050/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1747063551","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119050/23a4e10e0d1aa178e9de916c6092956a4f96fc17/